# Deployment settings for Neuman's decision core.
#
# Everything an operator changes while the appliance runs — accounts, roles,
# providers, models, the prompt — is made in the administration page, not
# here (D68, D107). These are the settings a restart changes.
#
# The registry is the one value this package must set: the manifests ship in
# /usr/share/neuman/registry rather than the /etc default.
NEUMAN_REGISTRY_DIR=/usr/share/neuman/registry

# The rest are the server's defaults, listed so an operator can see what they
# are without reading the source. Uncomment to change one.
# NEUMAN_DATABASE_URL=postgresql:///neuman?host=/run/postgresql
# NEUMAN_STATE_DIR=/var/lib/neuman/state
# NEUMAN_AUDIT_MIRROR=/var/log/neuman/audit.jsonl
# NEUMAN_ADMIN_SOCKET=/run/neuman/admin/admin.sock
# NEUMAN_MODELS_DIR=/var/lib/neuman/models
# NEUMAN_BIND=127.0.0.1
# NEUMAN_PORT=8443
# NEUMAN_MAX_TOKENS=4096
# NEUMAN_SESSION_RETENTION_DAYS=0
# NEUMAN_AUDIT_RETENTION_DAYS=0
#
# TLS: required for a client on another machine. The certificate and key must
# be readable by the `neuman` user.
# NEUMAN_TLS_CERT=/etc/neuman/tls/cert.pem
# NEUMAN_TLS_KEY=/etc/neuman/tls/key.pem
